{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2021-07-22 06:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIR GROUP REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'SEATTLE, JULY 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FINANCIAL RESULTS: REPORTED NET INCOME FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021 UNDER GENERALLY ACCEPTED ACCOUNTING PRINCIPLES (GAAP) OF $397 MILLION, OR $3.15 PER SHARE, COMPARED TO A NET LOSS OF $214 MILLION, OR $1.74 PER SHARE IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2020. REPORTED A NET LOSS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021, EXCLUDING CARES ACT PAYROLL SUPPORT PROGRAM (PSP) WAGE OFFSETS, SPECIAL ITEMS AND MARK-TO-MARKET FUEL HEDGE ACCOUNTING ADJUSTMENTS, OF $38 MILLION, OR $0.30 PER SHARE, COMPARED TO AN ADJUSTED NET LOSS OF $439 MILLION OR $3.57 PER SHARE, IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2020.'}